<title>UK: GOLF-DRAW FOR OPENING SOLHEIM CUP FOURSOMES.</title>
<headline>GOLF-DRAW FOR OPENING SOLHEIM CUP FOURSOMES.</headline>
<dateline>CHEPSTOW, Wales 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Draw for the first set</p>
